{
  "Scenes.Ghoulscene.GhoulEncounter.HyenaChargeBegins": " But it hardly matters. The hyena has spotted you and is charging at you, ruining any more contemplation. Instead, you prep yourself for a fight."
  "Scenes.Ghoulscene.GhoulEncounter.HyenaSpottingIntro": "As you wander the desert, your eyes catch something moving. You look in its direction. It's a hyena. Not a hyena-morph, but a literal hyena. If that wasn't weird enough, you're pretty certain anything hyena would be found "
  "Scenes.Ghoulscene.GhoulEncounter.LocatedAtPlains": "at the Plains."
  "Scenes.Ghoulscene.GhoulEncounter.LocatedElsewhere": "elsewhere."
  "Scenes.Ghoulscene.GhoulWon.DefeatFromLust": "You fall into the sand, your lust too overpowering. "
  "Scenes.Ghoulscene.GhoulWon.DefeatFromWounds": "You fall into the sand, your wounds too great. "
  "Scenes.Ghoulscene.GhoulWon.GhoulLunges": "The ghoul wastes no time and lunges forward at you. The last thing you see before you pass out is the ghoul's outstretched jaws."
  "Scenes.Ghoulscene.GhoulWon.WakingAfterAttack": "[pg]You have no idea what time it is when you wake up. Bite marks and other wounds cover your body, and pain wracks you with every breath you take. The sand is red with your blood and the metallic smell makes your stomach churn, but at the very least, you don't seem to be bleeding anymore. With great effort, you heave yourself up and stagger your way back to camp."
}
